would call it 'super intelligence', because 'artificial' made the technology sound fake. Trump told delegates that US documents, \" and hopefully the world's \", would switch to what he called the \" much more accurate term \", according to accounts from Fox News and Futurism . Trump said the US would encourage the technology and \" not rein it in \", a line CNBC also pulled from the speech. He paired that with a rejection of international oversight. The US would not accept any global mechanism to control the technology, he said, according to Fox News and Ynet .", "raw_actor_fields": {"acting_entity": null, "actor": null, "company": null, "institution": null, "organisation": null, "organization": null, "primary_actor": "Donald Trump", "regulator": null}, "raw_entity_mentions": [{"entity_type": "person", "mention": "Trump", "raw_keys": ["context", "entity_type", "mention", "role", "sentence_id", "source_span", "type_source"], "role": "actor"}, {"entity_type": "unknown", "mention": "UN General Assembly", "raw_keys": ["context", "entity_type", "mention", "role", "sentence_id", "source_span", "type_source"], "role": "object"}], "resolved_primary_actor": "Donald Trump", "source_id": "SOURCE-2B7353670B018A3630DE0F0F"}, {"admission_reasons": [], "admission_status": "considered", "diagnostic_version": "strategic-actor-admission-diagnostics-v1", "entity_mentions_state": "present", "event_id": "EVENT-E0AE0F1BAEC6A9604B083A0F", "event_keys": ["actor_recovered_from", "claim_status", "created_at", "entity_mentions", "event_date_precision", "event_dates_version", "event_end_at", "event_id", "event_start_at", "event_time_resolved", "event_time_text", "event_type", "extraction_metadata", "primary_actor", "published_at", "quantitative_claims", "relationship_mentions", "snippets", "source_id", "strategic_admission_reasons", "strategic_admission_status", "strategic_cluster_check", "strategic_cluster_development", "strategic_cluster_id", "strategic_cluster_label", "strategic_cluster_st