rebranded as \"super intelligence\""}, {"date": "2026-09-22", "event_id": "EVENT-E563C9EC636D95264E3E6B7C", "evidence_id": "EVID-11607D88B3D101C670B01E16", "found_by_follow_up_search": false, "source_id": "SOURCE-357916E6FC17B3F16C523F2F", "text": "\"The United States ... totally rejects any attempt to construct a globalist scheme to control for the artificial intelligence being spoken of so much now,\" he said."}, {"date": "2026-09-22", "event_id": "EVENT-BA4225A7CEA2291C1DCB3CA7", "evidence_id": "EVID-5AB3DE7E822691295FEBB259", "found_by_follow_up_search": false, "source_id": "SOURCE-7EA7844C9D194FECD5069C88", "text": "President Donald Trump on Tuesday announced that the US government would rename artificial intelligence \"super intelligence\" in official communications, as world leaders jostled over how to address the dangers of the fast-advancing technology."}, {"date": "2026-09-22", "event_id": "EVENT-BAEEEC1D65A033D1EB45D8C6", "evidence_id": "EVID-F267DE49228B0EF3F47F4CD2", "found_by_follow_up_search": true, "source_id": "SOURCE-2B7353670B018A3630DE0F0F", "text": "Earlier this month, Senator Bernie Sanders and Representative Greg Casar introduced the Ban Artificial Superintelligence Act , which would outlaw the very kind of system Trump has now made the official name for all of AI."}, {"date": "2026-09-22", "event_id": "EVENT-BAEEEC1D65A033D1EB45D8C6", "evidence_id": "EVID-1E5DEBA526FD1A9DE74ED745", "found_by_follow_up_search": true, "source_id": "SOURCE-2B7353670B018A3630DE0F0F", "text": "Trump told delegates that US documents, \" and hopefully the world's \", would switch to what he called the \" much more accurate term \", according to accounts from Fox News and Futurism ."}, {"date": "2026-09-29", "event_id": "EVENT-0692077A01AB5768A7379A1F", "evidence_id": "EVID-808B077A6D3328EF891D3581", "found_by_follow_up_search": true, "source_id": "SOURCE-C17896B7BB016684E2B7610E", "text": "In brief public remarks after the meeting, flanked by Nvidia CEO Jensen Huang and Tesla and SpaceX CEO Elon Musk, and surrounded by other attendees, Trump called the lunch \"very productive\" and \"extremely friendly.\""}], "kind": "shared_development", "sources": [{"published_at": "2026-09-22 16:00:00", "publisher": "scientificamerican.com", "source_id": "SOURCE-357916E6FC17B3F16C523F2F", "title": "Trump rejects AI regulation, citing parallels with climate change, in U.N. address", "url": "https://www.scientificamerican.com/article/trump-rejects-ai-regulation-citing-parallels-with-climate-change-in-un-address/"}, {"published_at": "2026-09-22 17:30:21", "publisher": "yahoo.com", "source_id": "SOURCE-7EA7844C9D194FECD5069C88", "title": "Trump renames AI 'super intelligence' as leaders jostle over dangers", "url": "https://www.yahoo.com/news/politics/articles/trump-rejects-international-regulation-ai-160957080.html"}, {"published_at": "2026-09-22 19:06:26", "publisher": "thenextweb.com", "source_id": "SOURCE-2B7353670B018A3630DE0F0F", "title": "Trump renames AI 'super intelligence' at the UN", "url": "https://thenextweb.com/news/trump-tells-the-un-that-ai-is-now-super-intelligence"}, {"published_at": "2026-09-29 22:25:45", "publisher": "theverge.com", "source_id": "SOURCE-C17896B7BB016684E2B7610E", "title": "Trump orders US government to call AI ‘Super Intelligence’", "url": "https://www.theverge.com/policy/1002468/trump-ai-superintelligence-executive-order-ai"}], "title": "US government officially renaming artificial intelligence to super intelligence", "what_to_watch": ["Size: the collected articles give no figures (money, capacity, users).", "Problems: delays, criticism, legal or regulatory pushback."]}, {"actors": ["Anthony Albanese", "OpenAI", "Australia"], "development_id": "DEVELOPMENT-C6CF9F8013EDF58D", "event_ids": ["EVENT-54C6889074514DB80817D5F1", "EVENT-A3B8FD875368991477715507", "EVENT-C1C55AA25B2776786296EFE9"], "events_found_by_follow_up_search": 2, "facts": [{"date": "2026-09-23", "event_id": "EVENT-54C6889074514DB80817D5F1", "evidence_id": "EVID-C2A4F05609A8DF3032E36EDE", "found_by_follow_up_search": false, "source_id": "SOURCE-7293333F143C87D2D74A144F", "text": "(At the UN Wednesday Australian Prime Minister Anthony Albanese complained it took three months for OpenAI to then alert Australia's government about the breach, Bloomberg reports .)"}, {"date": "2026-09-24", "event_id": "EVENT-A3B8FD875368991477715507", "evidence_id": "EVID-05629E828820086B4771C357", "found_by_follow_up_search": true, "source_id": "SOURCE-F18A16A215F6F4E8AFB0CE3F", "text": "CANBERRA -- Australia has created a taskforce to undertake a \"rapid\" review of a hack by an OpenAI artificial intelligence agent of a government health website, as experts warn the incident serves as \" another canary in the coal mine\" for cyber security risks posed by artificial intelligence."}, {"date": "2026-09-24", "event_id": "EVENT-A3B8FD875368991477715507", "evidence_id": "EVID-06D1EA867C27CA1A9C150AE1", "found_by_follow_up_search": true, "source_id": "SOURCE-F18A16A215F6F4E8AFB0CE3F", "text": "Australian Prime Minister Anthony Albanese, left, says he has expressed \"extreme concern\" to OpenAI chief executive Sam Altman over a company AI agent having gained unauthorized access to non-public files from a government website."}, {"date": "2026-09-24", "event_id": "EVENT-C1C55AA25B2776786296EFE9", "evidence_id": "EVID-F74C55A7592218AFF8E81EE7", "found_by_follow_up_search": true, "source_id": "SOURCE-F18A16A215F6F4E8AFB0CE3F", "text": "CANBERRA -- Australia has created a taskforce to undertake a \"rapid\" review of a hack by an OpenAI artificial intelligence agent of a government health website, as experts warn the incident serves as \" another canary in the coal mine\" for cyber security risks posed by artificial intelligence."}], "kind": "shared_development", "sources": [{"published_at": "2026-09-24 05:34:00", "publisher": "slashdot.org", "source_id": "SOURCE-7293333F143C87D2D74A144F", "title": "Rogue OpenAI Agent Tried to Breach Government Site in May When Prompted for Simple Data-Retrieving Tasks - Slashdot", "url": "https://slashdot.org/story/26/09/24/0528251/rogue-openai-agent-tried-to-breach-government-site-in-may-when-prompted-for-simple-data-retrieving-tasks"}, {"published_at": "2026-09-24 07:17:41", "publisher": "asia.nikkei.com", "source_id": "SOURCE-F18A16A215F6F4E8AFB0CE3F", "title": "Australia reveals OpenAI agent hacked government health website", "url": "https://asia.nikkei.com/business/technology/artificial-intelligence/australia-reveals-openai-agent-hacked-government-health-website"}], "title": "unauthorized access by OpenAI AI agents to government website data", "what_to_watch": ["Size: the collected articles give no figures (money, capacity, users).", "Problems: delays, criticism, legal or regulatory pushback."]}, {"actors": ["Commission"], "development_id": "DEVELOPMENT-34BA64B94865CE0C", "event_ids": ["EVENT-0242507B013C85729657D3F8"], "events_found_by_follow_up_search": 0, "facts": [{"date": "2026-08-02", "event_id": "EVENT-0242507B013C85729657D3F8", "evidence_id": "EVID-65CFAEF5390DEF6D131BE273", "found_by_follow_up_search": false, "source_id": "SOURCE-522409DCAF21B3E9CFDA38B3", "text": "Article 55 of the AI Act has obliged providers of general-purpose models with systemic risk to run adversarial testing, assess risk at union level and report serious incidents without undue delay since August 2025."}, {"date": "2026-08-02", "event_id": "EVENT-0242507B013C85729657D3F8", "evidence_id": "EVID-52B4FF635215A384AF63E0FF", "found_by_follow_up_search": false, "source_id": "SOURCE-522409DCAF21B3E9CFDA38B3", "text": "The European Union has required them since August 2025, and since 2 August this year the Commission has been able to fine a model provider 3% of worldwide turnover."}], "kind": "single_event", "sources": [{"published_at": "2026-09-25 17:16:30", "publisher": "thenextweb.com", "source_id": "SOURCE-522409DCAF21B3E9CFDA38B3", "title": "Bill Gates warns AI could cause a billion deaths and says self-regulation is not enough", "url": "https://thenextweb.com/news/gates-ai-risk-eu-enforcement"}], "title": "The European Union has required them since August 2025, and since 2 August this year the Commission has been able to fine a model provider 3% of worldwide turnover.", "what_to_watch": ["Independent confirmation: only one source in this run reports it.", "Follow-up: reported at one point in time so far; watch for later reports.", "Others: no other company reported doing the same in this run.", "Problems: delays, criticism, legal or regulatory pushback."]}, {"actors": ["The UAE"], "development_id": "DEVELOPMENT-89FA0FF11735DE76", "event_ids": ["EVENT-3AE5A3D6319852CE481A0068"], "events_found_by_follow_up_search": 0, "facts": [{"date": "2026-09-16", "event_id": "EVENT-3AE5A3D6319852CE481A0068", "evidence_id": "EVID-7325F9B741C4F218E623DF59", "found_by_follow_up_search": false, "source_id": "SOURCE-24F4829831F0B012068F4592", "text": "The UAE has trained 80,000 people in agentic AI, he said."}], "kind": "single_event", "sources": [{"published_at": "2026-09-16 03:53:58", "publisher": "thenextweb.com", "source_id": "SOURCE-24F4829831F0B012068F4592", "title": "UAE minister: data centres “more important than bridges”", "url": "https://thenextweb.com/news/uae-ai-minister-al-olama-data-centres-dreamforce-salesforce"}], "title": "The UAE has trained 80,000 people in agentic AI, he said.", "what_to_watch": ["Independent confirmation: only one source in this run reports it.", "Follow-up: reported at one point in time so far; watch for later reports.", "Others: no other company reported doing the same in this run.", "Problems: delays, criticism, legal or regulatory pushback."]}, {"actors": ["OpenAI"], "development_id": "DEVELOPMENT-F6AABC7015804993", "event_ids": ["EVENT-52048D4544FFBF623F69F9D4"], "events_found_by_follow_up_search": 1, "facts": [{"date": "2026-09-29", "event_id": "EVENT-52048D4544FFBF623F69F9D4", "evidence_id": "EVID-D12E008A570BC9BFC